(6106524, 899798, 60873, '<td valign="top">not bad at all. i like the way the water glows and the pattern of the dish makes it look wavey, my only dislike is the shells they''re too squishy and haphazzard. good job!</td>', 'not bad at all. i like the way the water glows and the pattern of the dish makes it look wavey, my only dislike is the shells they''re too squishy and haphazzard. good job!', '2010-07-28 01:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
