(6106635, 899767, 104537, '<td valign="top">very nice, love the shoes in the foreground. The image being dated may knock off on your score. Good luck</td>', 'very nice, love the shoes in the foreground. The image being dated may knock off on your score. Good luck', '2010-07-28 02:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106636, 900059, 104537, '<td valign="top">this looks delicious, very nice presentation.</td>', 'this looks delicious, very nice presentation.', '2010-07-28 02:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106652, 899171, 104537, '<td valign="top">This is my fav so far. Excellent choice on the background color, really emphasizes the vibrant colors of the salad.</td>', 'This is my fav so far. Excellent choice on the background color, really emphasizes the vibrant colors of the salad.', '2010-07-28 02:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106654, 900149, 69368, '<td valign="top">border is much overdone, IMO</td>', 'border is much overdone, IMO', '2010-07-28 02:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106655, 900159, 104537, '<td valign="top">So precious. The color of the watermelon really pops against this blue sky. Love it</td>', 'So precious. The color of the watermelon really pops against this blue sky. Love it', '2010-07-28 02:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106671, 900176, 119427, '<td valign="top">Great Shot - the word that came to mind when I saw this was ''refreshing'' :)</td>', 'Great Shot - the word that came to mind when I saw this was ''refreshing'' :)', '2010-07-28 03:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106762, 899812, 64670, '<td valign="top">Just REALLY like this image - don''t know why, but it''s <i>really</i> caught my attention - can''t look away.  I''m waiting for her to turn and notice me - GRIN!<br/> <br/>Love the square crop, the colours, the reflection - just think it''s FABULOUS!</td>', 'Just REALLY like this image - don''t know why, but it''s really caught my attention - can''t look away.  I''m waiting for her to turn and notice me - GRIN! Love the square crop, the colours, the reflection - just think it''s FABULOUS!', '2010-07-28 06:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106785, 900149, 117095, '<td valign="top">The border kills this one for me. I love the pic, but I think the border really detracts from it.</td>', 'The border kills this one for me. I love the pic, but I think the border really detracts from it.', '2010-07-28 07:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106823, 900073, 119012, '<td valign="top">a little more depth of field would have helped.</td>', 'a little more depth of field would have helped.', '2010-07-28 08:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106826, 900033, 119012, '<td valign="top">layouts nice, but it looks a little blown out.</td>', 'layouts nice, but it looks a little blown out.', '2010-07-28 08:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106828, 900067, 119012, '<td valign="top">i had to look for the bee. I wouldn''t have know it was there if not for the title.</td>', 'i had to look for the bee. I wouldn''t have know it was there if not for the title.', '2010-07-28 08:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106830, 899152, 119012, '<td valign="top">only comes with half a beer?</td>', 'only comes with half a beer?', '2010-07-28 08:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106839, 898927, 19035, '<td valign="top">mmmmmmm!</td>', 'mmmmmmm!', '2010-07-28 08:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106869, 900091, 114225, '<td valign="top">Yum. You really have all your bases covered from the beginning to the end of the meal. Nice setup and lighting.</td>', 'Yum. You really have all your bases covered from the beginning to the end of the meal. Nice setup and lighting.', '2010-07-28 09:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106872, 900111, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job showing off the textures, much of that seems to be attributable to the side light. The plate seems a little strange though. It looks like pizza dough.</td>', 'Great job showing off the textures, much of that seems to be attributable to the side light. The plate seems a little strange though. It looks like pizza dough.', '2010-07-28 09:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106875, 899606, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good time of day to take the photo. Gives it a warm feel. I probably would have chosen to put a slice of the desert on another (smaller) plater to that we could see the gooy-ness of it.</td>', 'Good time of day to take the photo. Gives it a warm feel. I probably would have chosen to put a slice of the desert on another (smaller) plater to that we could see the gooy-ness of it.', '2010-07-28 09:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106877, 900197, 114225, '<td valign="top">My all time favorite summer food :)<br/>I like the caught in the act feel to this. I do wish the background were a bit more blurred so that more focus can be given to the main subject.</td>', 'My all time favorite summer food :)I like the caught in the act feel to this. I do wish the background were a bit more blurred so that more focus can be given to the main subject.', '2010-07-28 09:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106881, 900041, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great details in this photo. One thing I would suggest is to try to get fewer reflections. Sometimes this can be difficult, but I found that with playing with lighting you can eventually do it.</td>', 'Great details in this photo. One thing I would suggest is to try to get fewer reflections. Sometimes this can be difficult, but I found that with playing with lighting you can eventually do it.', '2010-07-28 09:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106883, 899171, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good job using a diffused light to keep the reflection to a minimum, and great action to this shot.</td>', 'Nicely done. Good job using a diffused light to keep the reflection to a minimum, and great action to this shot.', '2010-07-28 09:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106885, 899723, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful setup, lighting, and details in the food. I''m glad you chose to cut off corners of the plates/top of the wine glass, as that really gives the shot a more intimate feel.</td>', 'Wonderful setup, lighting, and details in the food. I''m glad you chose to cut off corners of the plates/top of the wine glass, as that really gives the shot a more intimate feel.', '2010-07-28 09:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106886, 900101, 114225, '<td valign="top">I can smell them through the monitor!<br/>I like the overall setup here. I would suggest just one thing; use the negative space to maybe have a pile of strawberries falling into the frame. As it is, it feels like the wooden table is wasted space.</td>', 'I can smell them through the monitor!I like the overall setup here. I would suggest just one thing; use the negative space to maybe have a pile of strawberries falling into the frame. As it is, it feels like the wooden table is wasted space.', '2010-07-28 09:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106887, 900176, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing the details of the strawberry. I could see this being used in a commercial.</td>', 'Nice job capturing the details of the strawberry. I could see this being used in a commercial.', '2010-07-28 09:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106888, 900177, 114225, '<td valign="top">Look tasty. I like the top down view for this photo, as it highlights the symmetry of the salad.</td>', 'Look tasty. I like the top down view for this photo, as it highlights the symmetry of the salad.', '2010-07-28 09:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106890, 899798, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute! I love the idea here. I would suggest working on the lighting a bit. some parts of the image are pretty dark, and there are a lot of little reflections (diffusing the light could have helped with that).</td>', 'Cute! I love the idea here. I would suggest working on the lighting a bit. some parts of the image are pretty dark, and there are a lot of little reflections (diffusing the light could have helped with that).', '2010-07-28 09:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106892, 900057, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge (and great title). Nice job getting in close and using a shallow DOF.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge (and great title). Nice job getting in close and using a shallow DOF.', '2010-07-28 09:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106893, 900166, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how you use tile to get the entire subject into frame. However, I feel like there is something missing from the bottom left side of the image. I don''t know what it is, just feels like something should be there.</td>', 'I like how you use tile to get the entire subject into frame. However, I feel like there is something missing from the bottom left side of the image. I don''t know what it is, just feels like something should be there.', '2010-07-28 09:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106894, 899799, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea for the challenge. Nice clarity and depth of field. I don''t care for the border at all (it seems to actually take away from this image).</td>', 'Interesting idea for the challenge. Nice clarity and depth of field. I don''t care for the border at all (it seems to actually take away from this image).', '2010-07-28 09:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106895, 900129, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the challenge. You picked a good angle to photograph this from. I wonder if getting in even closer could have helped bring out more of the textures in the food.</td>', 'Good idea for the challenge. You picked a good angle to photograph this from. I wonder if getting in even closer could have helped bring out more of the textures in the food.', '2010-07-28 09:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106896, 900073, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how the background elements add a little bit of interest to a relatively dull subject (sorry, that''s just my opinion!).</td>', 'I like how the background elements add a little bit of interest to a relatively dull subject (sorry, that''s just my opinion!).', '2010-07-28 09:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106898, 900067, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the composition used here.</td>', 'I like the composition used here.', '2010-07-28 09:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106899, 900191, 114225, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, but the lack of sharpness across the ant is hurting the photo.</td>', 'Creative idea, but the lack of sharpness across the ant is hurting the photo.', '2010-07-28 09:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106909, 899772, 114225, '<td valign="top">Classic summer scene with the sun falling in the sky. To me, there is almost a bit too much light rays, as it''s covering your main subjects quite a bit.</td>', 'Classic summer scene with the sun falling in the sky. To me, there is almost a bit too much light rays, as it''s covering your main subjects quite a bit.', '2010-07-28 09:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106913, 900046, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good close scene, but something feels a bit off. Looks like perfect focus wasn''t quite achieved, making this photo softer than it could have been.</td>', 'Good close scene, but something feels a bit off. Looks like perfect focus wasn''t quite achieved, making this photo softer than it could have been.', '2010-07-28 09:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106916, 900080, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good job setting up the shot. The bread in the background adds a bit of interest. The bright reflection is distracting to me. I wonder if you could have somehow diffused that.</td>', 'Good job setting up the shot. The bread in the background adds a bit of interest. The bright reflection is distracting to me. I wonder if you could have somehow diffused that.', '2010-07-28 09:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106919, 899714, 114225, '<td valign="top">Look t it sizzle! Good textures in the meat. I wonder if a closer crop could have made this even better (so you could just see the steak, fire, and only a very small amount of grill.</td>', 'Look t it sizzle! Good textures in the meat. I wonder if a closer crop could have made this even better (so you could just see the steak, fire, and only a very small amount of grill.', '2010-07-28 09:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106924, 900037, 114225, '<td valign="top">The cool smoke adds a nice touch of mystery to this photo. I like how well its lit, that brings out a lot of the details in the food.</td>', 'The cool smoke adds a nice touch of mystery to this photo. I like how well its lit, that brings out a lot of the details in the food.', '2010-07-28 09:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106929, 898715, 114225, '<td valign="top">A definite classic summer food. Two things that could have improved this photo: Different lighting (did you use an on camera flash) to highlight details. More clarity (it actually looks like there might be a bit of camera shake happening, so maybe a tripod would have been in order).</td>', 'A definite classic summer food. Two things that could have improved this photo: Different lighting (did you use an on camera flash) to highlight details. More clarity (it actually looks like there might be a bit of camera shake happening, so maybe a tripod would have been in order).', '2010-07-28 09:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106932, 899778, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely setup. Good job with perspective, lighting, and food prep. I kind of wonder if the utensils would have been even better on the right side, so that they balanced the photo (opposite the broccoli).</td>', 'Nicely setup. Good job with perspective, lighting, and food prep. I kind of wonder if the utensils would have been even better on the right side, so that they balanced the photo (opposite the broccoli).', '2010-07-28 09:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106936, 899771, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good composition, it really makes it feel like he is hiding in there. The border on this photo is well done, gives it a classic feel.</td>', 'Good composition, it really makes it feel like he is hiding in there. The border on this photo is well done, gives it a classic feel.', '2010-07-28 10:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106938, 900043, 114225, '<td valign="top">Well, ok, I can see that grazing on grass may be counted as a summer food, and this photo is cute, but overall it really doesn''t feel like it meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Well, ok, I can see that grazing on grass may be counted as a summer food, and this photo is cute, but overall it really doesn''t feel like it meets the challenge well.', '2010-07-28 10:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106939, 899040, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. The closeness really shows the textures in the food. I would suggest to use a background that doesn''t have a distracting element in it.</td>', 'Great perspective. The closeness really shows the textures in the food. I would suggest to use a background that doesn''t have a distracting element in it.', '2010-07-28 10:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106940, 900200, 114225, '<td valign="top">Classic summer food in a classic summer location. I like how the sun is just barely peaking through the buildings.</td>', 'Classic summer food in a classic summer location. I like how the sun is just barely peaking through the buildings.', '2010-07-28 10:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106943, 900055, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity to this shot. I like the tilted perspective, and good balance to the photo (bread offsetting the fork).</td>', 'Wonderful clarity to this shot. I like the tilted perspective, and good balance to the photo (bread offsetting the fork).', '2010-07-28 10:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106946, 899807, 114225, '<td valign="top">Some good looking meat there. My suggestion for this photo would be to use some extra light soure to really bring out the details in the food. An off camera flash (low power) could help a lot.</td>', 'Some good looking meat there. My suggestion for this photo would be to use some extra light soure to really bring out the details in the food. An off camera flash (low power) could help a lot.', '2010-07-28 10:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106949, 900120, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity and colors in this photo. The white background really makes the food pop.</td>', 'Nice clarity and colors in this photo. The white background really makes the food pop.', '2010-07-28 10:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106950, 900105, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute title :)<br/>Great use of depth of field and good warmth to the photo. Also, great balance in the composition (even the background lights are balanced).</td>', 'Cute title :)Great use of depth of field and good warmth to the photo. Also, great balance in the composition (even the background lights are balanced).', '2010-07-28 10:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106955, 900059, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, this is a good photo. Some things that could improve it: Better lighting to bring out the details. Probably a tighter crop, as the plate feels like it has just as much importance as the food (it shouldn''t).</td>', 'Overall, this is a good photo. Some things that could improve it: Better lighting to bring out the details. Probably a tighter crop, as the plate feels like it has just as much importance as the food (it shouldn''t).', '2010-07-28 10:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106956, 900134, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great perspective here. The closeness provides great details and textures while not containing distracting elements.</td>', 'Great perspective here. The closeness provides great details and textures while not containing distracting elements.', '2010-07-28 10:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106957, 900149, 93756, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition and the food looks good. I would have rotated this 1 or 2 degrees to make the diamond perfectly straight in the frame.</td>', 'Nice simple composition and the food looks good. I would have rotated this 1 or 2 degrees to make the diamond perfectly straight in the frame.', '2010-07-28 10:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106958, 899772, 93756, '<td valign="top">I love the concept and the sun glare. Wish less of the green trees in the background were showing. You could have exposed for the watermelon and let the background get blown out to be lighter and also decreased your depth of field to really focus on the fruit.</td>', 'I love the concept and the sun glare. Wish less of the green trees in the background were showing. You could have exposed for the watermelon and let the background get blown out to be lighter and also decreased your depth of field to really focus on the fruit.', '2010-07-28 10:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106959, 898944, 93756, '<td valign="top">The food looks good - hard to do! <br/>What doesn''t work so well are your angles. The cutting board is not quite evenly cropped at the corners of your frame and then the white plate is not quite a straight diamond in the frame. If you''d lined up the angles or pulled back a little so the corners of the plate weren''t cut off, this would not be grabbing my eye so much.</td>', 'The food looks good - hard to do! What doesn''t work so well are your angles. The cutting board is not quite evenly cropped at the corners of your frame and then the white plate is not quite a straight diamond in the frame. If you''d lined up the angles or pulled back a little so the corners of the plate weren''t cut off, this would not be grabbing my eye so much.', '2010-07-28 10:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106960, 899041, 93756, '<td valign="top">Burnt toast? I''m sorry to hear it. Just kidding, great simple photo - stands out from the rest.</td>', 'Burnt toast? I''m sorry to hear it. Just kidding, great simple photo - stands out from the rest.', '2010-07-28 10:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106961, 899101, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good perspective used in this shot. Gives a feeling of being right there, likely to get dripped on. I like how the lighting really helps to bring out some of the details.</td>', 'Good perspective used in this shot. Gives a feeling of being right there, likely to get dripped on. I like how the lighting really helps to bring out some of the details.', '2010-07-28 10:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106962, 899606, 93756, '<td valign="top">The food looks good and nicely arranged. I would use a shorter glass to pull the wine into the picture more so you could eliminate some of the green background. The split between the green &amp; white is right at the middle of the photo instead of the more appealing top third.</td>', 'The food looks good and nicely arranged. I would use a shorter glass to pull the wine into the picture more so you could eliminate some of the green background. The split between the green & white is right at the middle of the photo instead of the more appealing top third.', '2010-07-28 10:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106963, 900114, 93756, '<td valign="top">It''s a great picture - love the wet hair and drips. Meal? A bit of a stretch.</td>', 'It''s a great picture - love the wet hair and drips. Meal? A bit of a stretch.', '2010-07-28 10:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
