(6107292, 899723, 53147, '<td valign="top">This looks like a combination of a hotpasta type meal and a hotpasta type photograph. My top choice for the challenge. Great looking plate of food (man I do love fresh figs) and a pleasing arrangement.</td>', 'This looks like a combination of a hotpasta type meal and a hotpasta type photograph. My top choice for the challenge. Great looking plate of food (man I do love fresh figs) and a pleasing arrangement.', '2010-07-28 13:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6107293, 899041, 53147, '<td valign="top">When I think of the challenge name the first thing that come to mind is fresh bright color. Then i come across this image. It caught me off guard. Pleasantly unexpected and perfect for the challenge. I love all of the components - clean b&amp;w, every part is in it''s place with nothing overlapping, simplicity, great natural light - and all topped off with the window being open. My choice for red in this challenge.</td>', 'When I think of the challenge name the first thing that come to mind is fresh bright color. Then i come across this image. It caught me off guard. Pleasantly unexpected and perfect for the challenge. I love all of the components - clean b&w, every part is in it''s place with nothing overlapping, simplicity, great natural light - and all topped off with the window being open. My choice for red in this challenge.', '2010-07-28 13:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6107294, 898795, 53147, '<td valign="top">This throws me right back to our vacation camping just a month ago. Great idea for the challenge and well done photographically (is that a word?) My choice for yellow.</td>', 'This throws me right back to our vacation camping just a month ago. Great idea for the challenge and well done photographically (is that a word?) My choice for yellow.', '2010-07-28 13:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6107296, 900149, 49109, '<td valign="top">frame is way too bold</td>', 'frame is way too bold', '2010-07-28 13:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6107301, 898927, 53147, '<td valign="top">Is that actually a burger? Looks almost like a steak. Either way - I would eat it - but I would pull off the velveeta first. Very nice image. I have this ranked 4th overall.</td>', 'Is that actually a burger? Looks almost like a steak. Either way - I would eat it - but I would pull off the velveeta first. Very nice image. I have this ranked 4th overall.', '2010-07-28 13:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
