(6107305, 899812, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great urban fragment.  Love the large negative space planes surrounding her.  Beautifully balanced, and wonderful light gradient on the wall.  But this isn''t quite a meal, is it?</td>', 'Great urban fragment.  Love the large negative space planes surrounding her.  Beautifully balanced, and wonderful light gradient on the wall.  But this isn''t quite a meal, is it?', '2010-07-28 13:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
