(6107319, 900177, 53147, '<td valign="top">I dont know if it my monitor or just the editing, but your colors seem a bit flat. My personal desire with food (especially with a summer theme) is for vibrancy in color and light. I gave this a 7 - but with a tweak in color and light to make it pop more it would have scored higher.</td>', 'I dont know if it my monitor or just the editing, but your colors seem a bit flat. My personal desire with food (especially with a summer theme) is for vibrancy in color and light. I gave this a 7 - but with a tweak in color and light to make it pop more it would have scored higher.', '2010-07-28 13:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
