(6107347, 899736, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and colors, seems a bit oof, 5.</td>', 'Nice idea and colors, seems a bit oof, 5.', '2010-07-28 14:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6107348, 898944, 53147, '<td valign="top">OK - this is my take on the presentation of your plate. I would eat it ina second but your layout coudl be better. You have a cool square plate which could have been accented better had you curved the tomato and mozz. It comes up too far onto the edge and the straight line of the tom/mozz doesnt contrast with all of the other straight lines in the image. A curve would have been lovely. The balsamic reduction - had it been reduced down a bit more - could have been thicker which would allow for a cleaner plate design. The splatter just makes it look messy to me. And for a clean photo I would skip the black pepper. I know it tastes awesome but it just adds to the messiness. Something fresh and bright green would have been nice. A pair of chive sticks, a little chiffonade of basil. I am looking at this with eyes of a chef and a photographer. You have excellent components that could have been laid out a bit more pleasing,</td>', 'OK - this is my take on the presentation of your plate. I would eat it ina second but your layout coudl be better. You have a cool square plate which could have been accented better had you curved the tomato and mozz. It comes up too far onto the edge and the straight line of the tom/mozz doesnt contrast with all of the other straight lines in the image. A curve would have been lovely. The balsamic reduction - had it been reduced down a bit more - could have been thicker which would allow for a cleaner plate design. The splatter just makes it look messy to me. And for a clean photo I would skip the black pepper. I know it tastes awesome but it just adds to the messiness. Something fresh and bright green would have been nice. A pair of chive sticks, a little chiffonade of basil. I am looking at this with eyes of a chef and a photographer. You have excellent components that could have been laid out a bit more pleasing,', '2010-07-28 14:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6107349, 900129, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and comp, I dont look at this say "meal" I say snack. 5.</td>', 'Nice colors and comp, I dont look at this say "meal" I say snack. 5.', '2010-07-28 14:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
