(6109434, 900045, 116574, '<td valign="top">I know that shooting food is a tough challenge from all the cooking shows I watch but your dish looks unappetizing to me.  Your depth of field is too shallow to me, so I can''t see all the pasta in focus.  Perhaps if you had shot it a bit farther out  and then cropped in very close it would have appealed to me more..  I know that they utilizes different techniques when shooting food, Not that I know what they are AT ALL.  I didn''t try this challenge because I knew I could cook the dishes but didn''t think I knew enough about lighting to pull it off.  To me, your  lighting seems a bit flat and harsh.  Without enough contrast to help define all the food elements, they seem a bit muddled. although this is not a cooking challenge, one of my criteria for judging these food shots, at least the people food, is does it make me want to eat it. Since  we eat with our eyes just as much as we do with our noses and taste buds, I don''t want to eat your dish.</td>', 'I know that shooting food is a tough challenge from all the cooking shows I watch but your dish looks unappetizing to me.  Your depth of field is too shallow to me, so I can''t see all the pasta in focus.  Perhaps if you had shot it a bit farther out  and then cropped in very close it would have appealed to me more..  I know that they utilizes different techniques when shooting food, Not that I know what they are AT ALL.  I didn''t try this challenge because I knew I could cook the dishes but didn''t think I knew enough about lighting to pull it off.  To me, your  lighting seems a bit flat and harsh.  Without enough contrast to help define all the food elements, they seem a bit muddled. although this is not a cooking challenge, one of my criteria for judging these food shots, at least the people food, is does it make me want to eat it. Since  we eat with our eyes just as much as we do with our noses and taste buds, I don''t want to eat your dish.', '2010-07-30 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6109537, 900061, 102519, '<td valign="top">focus is on the drink.....sorry but to me thats off</td>', 'focus is on the drink.....sorry but to me thats off', '2010-07-30 13:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
