(6110285, 899807, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was taken in open shade, which is why there is a blue/cyan tint to the image.  Food usually looks more appetizing when the color cast is slightly warm.</td>', 'This looks like it was taken in open shade, which is why there is a blue/cyan tint to the image.  Food usually looks more appetizing when the color cast is slightly warm.', '2010-07-31 10:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110287, 899717, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish this was sharp all the way through.</td>', 'I wish this was sharp all the way through.', '2010-07-31 10:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110288, 899778, 47470, '<td valign="top">Between the numerous items of food, the pattern on the plate, and the silverware in the corner, this image is too busy.  When shooting food, it is also good to brush melted butter or oil over the food so there are some highlights, which make food look tasty!</td>', 'Between the numerous items of food, the pattern on the plate, and the silverware in the corner, this image is too busy.  When shooting food, it is also good to brush melted butter or oil over the food so there are some highlights, which make food look tasty!', '2010-07-31 10:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110289, 899152, 118008, '<td valign="top">could have been a really good shot if the light was hitting the food and maybe if the salad was in front of the main course</td>', 'could have been a really good shot if the light was hitting the food and maybe if the salad was in front of the main course', '2010-07-31 10:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110291, 899789, 118008, '<td valign="top">could use a little more color in the background but i love the plate set up of the hotdogs and buns</td>', 'could use a little more color in the background but i love the plate set up of the hotdogs and buns', '2010-07-31 10:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110292, 900037, 47470, '<td valign="top">The smoke makes the food look a bit scary, and ice cream should never be scary : )  The light is done very well though.</td>', 'The smoke makes the food look a bit scary, and ice cream should never be scary : )  The light is done very well though.', '2010-07-31 10:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110294, 900166, 118008, '<td valign="top">i kinda wish the lemons on the bottom were in focus too, but sometimes it''s hard to put everything you want in focus</td>', 'i kinda wish the lemons on the bottom were in focus too, but sometimes it''s hard to put everything you want in focus', '2010-07-31 10:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
