(6110306, 900139, 47470, '<td valign="top">It looks like the stick is more in focus than the food.  I love the red underglow from the fire, but I wish there was a little more light on the side facing the viewer.</td>', 'It looks like the stick is more in focus than the food.  I love the red underglow from the fire, but I wish there was a little more light on the side facing the viewer.', '2010-07-31 10:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
