(6110316, 900141, 118008, '<td valign="top">instead of all the stuff on the towel, i would have rather liked to see a person staring off into the distance</td>', 'instead of all the stuff on the towel, i would have rather liked to see a person staring off into the distance', '2010-07-31 10:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110318, 900059, 118008, '<td valign="top">too much shadow, but a great composition</td>', 'too much shadow, but a great composition', '2010-07-31 10:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110326, 900139, 118008, '<td valign="top">wish there was a little more light on the weenies but i love the fire in the background</td>', 'wish there was a little more light on the weenies but i love the fire in the background', '2010-07-31 10:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110327, 898715, 118008, '<td valign="top">definitely needs to be in focus</td>', 'definitely needs to be in focus', '2010-07-31 10:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110329, 899171, 118008, '<td valign="top">how did you get it to toss while taking the picture?</td>', 'how did you get it to toss while taking the picture?', '2010-07-31 10:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110359, 900055, 47470, '<td valign="top">Very clean with nice lighting.  I only wish that there was the tiniest bit more depth of field.</td>', 'Very clean with nice lighting.  I only wish that there was the tiniest bit more depth of field.', '2010-07-31 11:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110361, 900033, 47470, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit too harsh for my taste.  Many food magazines lately have been favoring harsh light on food, but I still prefer slightly softer light on the side facing the viewer.  The harsh backlight works well, though.</td>', 'The light is a bit too harsh for my taste.  Many food magazines lately have been favoring harsh light on food, but I still prefer slightly softer light on the side facing the viewer.  The harsh backlight works well, though.', '2010-07-31 11:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110363, 900141, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks like the "casual" kind of photos from the ''70s you see in art galleries.  The colors also help give that ''70s feel.</td>', 'This looks like the "casual" kind of photos from the ''70s you see in art galleries.  The colors also help give that ''70s feel.', '2010-07-31 11:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110364, 900200, 47470, '<td valign="top">The light on his face is beautiful, but I think the blown out parts of the top of the image are distracting.</td>', 'The light on his face is beautiful, but I think the blown out parts of the top of the image are distracting.', '2010-07-31 11:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110366, 900090, 47470, '<td valign="top">The light is too flat for my taste and I wish the background was cleaner.</td>', 'The light is too flat for my taste and I wish the background was cleaner.', '2010-07-31 11:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110367, 898715, 47470, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this is out of focus.  I wish the background gave more of a "summer" feel, like bright green grass, the bush it was picked from, or on a picnic table with a blueberry pie in the background.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this is out of focus.  I wish the background gave more of a "summer" feel, like bright green grass, the bush it was picked from, or on a picnic table with a blueberry pie in the background.', '2010-07-31 11:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110368, 899041, 47470, '<td valign="top">Very clean and simple.  The black and white works well.  I wish the bread was slightly lighter so it didn''t look burnt : )</td>', 'Very clean and simple.  The black and white works well.  I wish the bread was slightly lighter so it didn''t look burnt : )', '2010-07-31 11:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110369, 898928, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is slightly too close for the viewer to tell what it is right away.</td>', 'This is slightly too close for the viewer to tell what it is right away.', '2010-07-31 11:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110370, 900176, 47470, '<td valign="top">Even though this is not terribly original, it is still well done.</td>', 'Even though this is not terribly original, it is still well done.', '2010-07-31 11:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110371, 898927, 47470, '<td valign="top">The juicy burger, the salad, the chips/fries, and the beer look perfect.  I''m confused by the farthest back element--it looks like a burlap bag?  Whatever it is, it looks out of place.  The rest of the image is pretty much spot-on.  The light on the burger is perfect.</td>', 'The juicy burger, the salad, the chips/fries, and the beer look perfect.  I''m confused by the farthest back element--it looks like a burlap bag?  Whatever it is, it looks out of place.  The rest of the image is pretty much spot-on.  The light on the burger is perfect.', '2010-07-31 11:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110372, 899618, 47470, '<td valign="top">Tomatoes are hard to photograph with a shallow depth of field because their skin''s texture is such that it always looks out of focus even if it''s not.  A little more sharpening during post-processing would have brought out the parts of this that are definitely in focus, which would have helped the score (I''m guessing you''re getting a lot of "Out of focus!" comments).</td>', 'Tomatoes are hard to photograph with a shallow depth of field because their skin''s texture is such that it always looks out of focus even if it''s not.  A little more sharpening during post-processing would have brought out the parts of this that are definitely in focus, which would have helped the score (I''m guessing you''re getting a lot of "Out of focus!" comments).', '2010-07-31 11:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110389, 899040, 39787, '<td valign="top">Seeing this seriously made me hungry!</td>', 'Seeing this seriously made me hungry!', '2010-07-31 12:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110412, 899533, 47470, '<td valign="top">This photo would really pop with some sharpening.  I don''t think the voters will like this image paired with this challenge, but the sharpening would have helped a lot.  The colors would be gorgeous with a little boost too.</td>', 'This photo would really pop with some sharpening.  I don''t think the voters will like this image paired with this challenge, but the sharpening would have helped a lot.  The colors would be gorgeous with a little boost too.', '2010-07-31 13:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110415, 900061, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the front of the burger was in focus.  The light is a bit too harsh for my taste; a bit of diffusion that maintains the direction of the light would be more attractive.  Showing that grill a bit more in the background would have also helped establish the location, which might have added a wonderful background.</td>', 'I wish the front of the burger was in focus.  The light is a bit too harsh for my taste; a bit of diffusion that maintains the direction of the light would be more attractive.  Showing that grill a bit more in the background would have also helped establish the location, which might have added a wonderful background.', '2010-07-31 13:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110416, 900091, 47470, '<td valign="top">The tiniest bit too busy for my taste, but still very well done.  Very crisp and vibrant.  The harsh light works well here and gives a lovely sparkle in the beer.</td>', 'The tiniest bit too busy for my taste, but still very well done.  Very crisp and vibrant.  The harsh light works well here and gives a lovely sparkle in the beer.', '2010-07-31 13:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110417, 900120, 47470, '<td valign="top">I really light the light on the onion, but the green tomato could use a little brightening to make it a little more consistent with the other subjects.  I wish the cloth on the table was flat.  The tall veggie works very well as a natural border to keep the focus of the viewer in the image.  Nice overall shot.</td>', 'I really light the light on the onion, but the green tomato could use a little brightening to make it a little more consistent with the other subjects.  I wish the cloth on the table was flat.  The tall veggie works very well as a natural border to keep the focus of the viewer in the image.  Nice overall shot.', '2010-07-31 13:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110421, 898944, 47470, '<td valign="top">Yum!  This looks amazing!  I love the use of the unsymmetrical background--very well done.  The color palate is lovely too.</td>', 'Yum!  This looks amazing!  I love the use of the unsymmetrical background--very well done.  The color palate is lovely too.', '2010-07-31 13:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110422, 899040, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the background would have been either brighter or darker to contrast the tonal values of the subject.  I think the greenish-yellow of the plate is a little distracting.  Having the plate neutral would have helped bring out the food.  The composition is perfect for the subject, and I like the shallow depth of field, but I wish it included the closest berry too.</td>', 'I wish the background would have been either brighter or darker to contrast the tonal values of the subject.  I think the greenish-yellow of the plate is a little distracting.  Having the plate neutral would have helped bring out the food.  The composition is perfect for the subject, and I like the shallow depth of field, but I wish it included the closest berry too.', '2010-07-31 13:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110423, 900041, 47470, '<td valign="top">The harsh lighting helps make everything look extra juicy--very well done.  I also like the close crop and the simple background.</td>', 'The harsh lighting helps make everything look extra juicy--very well done.  I also like the close crop and the simple background.', '2010-07-31 13:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110424, 899789, 47470, '<td valign="top">The composition and the nearly neutral colored background work well, but I wish the lighting wasn''t almost directly overhead.  Having it come from one side, partially from behind the subject would be much more pleasing.</td>', 'The composition and the nearly neutral colored background work well, but I wish the lighting wasn''t almost directly overhead.  Having it come from one side, partially from behind the subject would be much more pleasing.', '2010-07-31 13:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110425, 900045, 47470, '<td valign="top">the depth of field is not quite deep enough for us to get a good feel for the dish.  More directional lighting would also help this photo.</td>', 'the depth of field is not quite deep enough for us to get a good feel for the dish.  More directional lighting would also help this photo.', '2010-07-31 13:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110427, 900073, 47470, '<td valign="top">The part of the salad that is is focus is nice and crisp, but I wish it was more into the frame instead of being cut off.</td>', 'The part of the salad that is is focus is nice and crisp, but I wish it was more into the frame instead of being cut off.', '2010-07-31 13:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110428, 899799, 47470, '<td valign="top">This probably would have done much better in the Free Study, especially since most people wouldn''t see the connection with the challenge without the title.</td>', 'This probably would have done much better in the Free Study, especially since most people wouldn''t see the connection with the challenge without the title.', '2010-07-31 13:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110429, 900159, 47470, '<td valign="top">The image is lovely, but that border is making my eyes go funny.  I love the clean background of the sky; it makes her stand out wonderfully.</td>', 'The image is lovely, but that border is making my eyes go funny.  I love the clean background of the sky; it makes her stand out wonderfully.', '2010-07-31 13:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110431, 900166, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the bottom of the gall was more in focus or more out of focus.</td>', 'I wish the bottom of the gall was more in focus or more out of focus.', '2010-07-31 13:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110433, 899714, 47470, '<td valign="top">The strong diagonal at the top of the image makes me wish the negative space was on the left instead of the right.</td>', 'The strong diagonal at the top of the image makes me wish the negative space was on the left instead of the right.', '2010-07-31 13:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110435, 900105, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the white plate was closer to white (it''s light grey).  I''m still on the fence about the bright bokeh at the top.</td>', 'I wish the white plate was closer to white (it''s light grey).  I''m still on the fence about the bright bokeh at the top.', '2010-07-31 13:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110436, 899004, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the use of high key in this image, but I wish it was sharper, particularly the eyelashes.</td>', 'I love the use of high key in this image, but I wish it was sharper, particularly the eyelashes.', '2010-07-31 13:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110439, 898795, 47470, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I half wish that you had taken out the bright blue box from the background since its colorful keeps drawing my gaze.  Either way, nice image.</td>', 'Well done.  I half wish that you had taken out the bright blue box from the background since its colorful keeps drawing my gaze.  Either way, nice image.', '2010-07-31 14:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110440, 900149, 47470, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the border.  It''s much too distracting.  I wish there was a little more contrast with the light on the subject, but I appreciate the simplicity of the image.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the border.  It''s much too distracting.  I wish there was a little more contrast with the light on the subject, but I appreciate the simplicity of the image.', '2010-07-31 14:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110441, 900177, 47470, '<td valign="top">The light is perfect for the type of food you photographed, but I think the background doesn''t fit.  The food looks more like an upper-class restaurant dish, but the background doesn''t match.</td>', 'The light is perfect for the type of food you photographed, but I think the background doesn''t fit.  The food looks more like an upper-class restaurant dish, but the background doesn''t match.', '2010-07-31 14:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110442, 900129, 47470, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting.  I love the contrast between the colors.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting.  I love the contrast between the colors.', '2010-07-31 14:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110446, 899723, 47470, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  The lighting is well done and you created a wonderful sense of place with the background (without making it too busy)!</td>', 'Wonderful image.  The lighting is well done and you created a wonderful sense of place with the background (without making it too busy)!', '2010-07-31 14:06:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6110451, 898944, 97923, '<td valign="top">That really looks appetizing. I wish the image was composed simpler.. The background with both wood and (stone?) is a little bit crowded.</td>', 'That really looks appetizing. I wish the image was composed simpler.. The background with both wood and (stone?) is a little bit crowded.', '2010-07-31 14:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110452, 900176, 97923, '<td valign="top">...more like a spring meal, but it looks good:)</td>', '...more like a spring meal, but it looks good:)', '2010-07-31 14:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110454, 900055, 97923, '<td valign="top">Nice stock photo. And it looks quite tasty, too. <br/>However, when photographing products (foods included) isn''t it preferable to have the whole product (in this case, dish) in focus ?</td>', 'Nice stock photo. And it looks quite tasty, too. However, when photographing products (foods included) isn''t it preferable to have the whole product (in this case, dish) in focus ?', '2010-07-31 14:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110551, 900159, 117831, '<td valign="top">i love this image and its my favorite for the blue! (10)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=900812" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117831/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_900812.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117831/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_900812.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117831/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_900812.jpg"/></a></td>', 'i love this image and its my favorite for the blue! (10)', '2010-07-31 17:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110552, 900105, 117831, '<td valign="top">very creative and great composition! top 3 (10)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=900812" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117831/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_900812.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117831/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_900812.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117831/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_900812.jpg"/></a></td>', 'very creative and great composition! top 3 (10)', '2010-07-31 17:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110553, 900091, 117831, '<td valign="top">great job top 3 (10)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=900812" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117831/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_900812.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117831/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_900812.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117831/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_900812.jpg"/></a></td>', 'great job top 3 (10)', '2010-07-31 17:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110554, 900037, 117831, '<td valign="top">very cool!! +2 for creativity + 1 for composition + 1 for clarity (9)</td>', 'very cool!! +2 for creativity + 1 for composition + 1 for clarity (9)', '2010-07-31 17:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110566, 899171, 117559, '<td valign="top">Good colours, nice composition...nicely put together.</td>', 'Good colours, nice composition...nicely put together.', '2010-07-31 17:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110571, 900073, 117559, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better with more colour.  I also find the reflection of the fork a bit distracting.</td>', 'I think this would have been better with more colour.  I also find the reflection of the fork a bit distracting.', '2010-07-31 17:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110574, 900055, 117559, '<td valign="top">Really like the fork and the angle of the image.  Lots of lovely colours too</td>', 'Really like the fork and the angle of the image.  Lots of lovely colours too', '2010-07-31 17:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110576, 900141, 117559, '<td valign="top">It has a summery haze to it, an extra point for that!</td>', 'It has a summery haze to it, an extra point for that!', '2010-07-31 17:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110578, 898715, 117559, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid it isn''t really in focus...I think that maybe a contrasting colour background could have helped too.</td>', 'I''m afraid it isn''t really in focus...I think that maybe a contrasting colour background could have helped too.', '2010-07-31 17:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110582, 899798, 117559, '<td valign="top">Took me a wee while to work out what was going on.  Interesting and creative idea....looks a bit yuck to me however...sorry.  Keep up the creativity though!</td>', 'Took me a wee while to work out what was going on.  Interesting and creative idea....looks a bit yuck to me however...sorry.  Keep up the creativity though!', '2010-07-31 17:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110584, 899778, 117559, '<td valign="top">The green is a nice addition of colour into the image.  I like it, but something feels a bit off...I think I would like to have seen it without the knife and fork.</td>', 'The green is a nice addition of colour into the image.  I like it, but something feels a bit off...I think I would like to have seen it without the knife and fork.', '2010-07-31 17:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110585, 899772, 117559, '<td valign="top">I like!  I love light glares like that!<br/>I think it would have been ever better had the melon beena bit reder...7</td>', 'I like!  I love light glares like that!I think it would have been ever better had the melon beena bit reder...7', '2010-07-31 17:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110590, 900101, 117559, '<td valign="top">Lovely red colour!  I also love the composition of the image, I think it worked cutting some of the board out of the image.</td>', 'Lovely red colour!  I also love the composition of the image, I think it worked cutting some of the board out of the image.', '2010-07-31 17:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110592, 900134, 117559, '<td valign="top">One of the best hotdog images I have seen so far.<br/>Really good angle and much nicer colours than I have seen...also love the detail of the grill marks and the focus on the hotdogs. 8</td>', 'One of the best hotdog images I have seen so far.Really good angle and much nicer colours than I have seen...also love the detail of the grill marks and the focus on the hotdogs. 8', '2010-07-31 17:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110595, 899101, 117559, '<td valign="top">Great image, his teeth are really white!<br/>Is there a bit of a "haze" around his hand and the blue??  Meh, I still give you a 9</td>', 'Great image, his teeth are really white!Is there a bit of a "haze" around his hand and the blue??  Meh, I still give you a 9', '2010-07-31 17:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110603, 899041, 117559, '<td valign="top">Ohhh...interesting...a black and white summer image.  I wasn''t expecting that.<br/>I like the layout and the simplicity of the image....not sure if it really is a "summer breakfast"...and the toast looks a bit burnt.<br/>I still think it is a great image. Not sure that it really fits into the challenge, but I''ll trust it does. 8</td>', 'Ohhh...interesting...a black and white summer image.  I wasn''t expecting that.I like the layout and the simplicity of the image....not sure if it really is a "summer breakfast"...and the toast looks a bit burnt.I still think it is a great image. Not sure that it really fits into the challenge, but I''ll trust it does. 8', '2010-07-31 17:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110619, 900134, 114657, '<td valign="top">Light and the colors are really good.</td>', 'Light and the colors are really good.', '2010-07-31 17:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110629, 900105, 114657, '<td valign="top">Light, colors and framing is good.</td>', 'Light, colors and framing is good.', '2010-07-31 17:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110744, 900177, 38930, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge perfectly and looks delicious!</td>', 'This fits the challenge perfectly and looks delicious!', '2010-07-31 20:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110745, 899041, 38930, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this shot</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this shot', '2010-07-31 20:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110747, 900120, 38930, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Great foods... they might have looked a bit more "fresh" if you sprayed them with water first.</td>', 'Nice!  Great foods... they might have looked a bit more "fresh" if you sprayed them with water first.', '2010-07-31 20:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110749, 900149, 38930, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  The flash is giving it harsh light, so just pointing the flash away from the food will make the shadows go away :)</td>', 'Great idea!  The flash is giving it harsh light, so just pointing the flash away from the food will make the shadows go away :)', '2010-07-31 20:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110750, 899723, 38930, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is fantastic!  The lighting and set-up on this is perfect.  10</td>', 'Wow, this is fantastic!  The lighting and set-up on this is perfect.  10', '2010-07-31 20:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110751, 900091, 38930, '<td valign="top">This looks delicious!</td>', 'This looks delicious!', '2010-07-31 20:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110753, 900045, 38930, '<td valign="top">The food looks great!  As a suggestion, if you remove the color blue from the plate, it will look pure white</td>', 'The food looks great!  As a suggestion, if you remove the color blue from the plate, it will look pure white', '2010-07-31 20:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110754, 900067, 38930, '<td valign="top">Ha, nice idea and great timing</td>', 'Ha, nice idea and great timing', '2010-07-31 20:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110756, 898927, 38930, '<td valign="top">HUUUGE!  I''m sold.  This is great!</td>', 'HUUUGE!  I''m sold.  This is great!', '2010-07-31 20:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110758, 900111, 38930, '<td valign="top">Nice picture - it fits the challenge perfectly</td>', 'Nice picture - it fits the challenge perfectly', '2010-07-31 20:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110759, 900191, 38930, '<td valign="top">It is a summertime meal!  Great find!</td>', 'It is a summertime meal!  Great find!', '2010-07-31 20:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110762, 899677, 38930, '<td valign="top">Whoah, that''s crazy!  This is really cool</td>', 'Whoah, that''s crazy!  This is really cool', '2010-07-31 20:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110763, 900061, 38930, '<td valign="top">Great set-up!  The flash seems a little harsh, but a little diffusion would make the lighting perfect</td>', 'Great set-up!  The flash seems a little harsh, but a little diffusion would make the lighting perfect', '2010-07-31 20:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110766, 899789, 38930, '<td valign="top">Mmmm.... yum!  Perfect meal for the challenge!</td>', 'Mmmm.... yum!  Perfect meal for the challenge!', '2010-07-31 20:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110767, 900105, 38930, '<td valign="top">Nice composition!  Did you try lowering the white balance (Kelvin) so it wasn''t so yellow?</td>', 'Nice composition!  Did you try lowering the white balance (Kelvin) so it wasn''t so yellow?', '2010-07-31 20:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6110772, 900166, 38930, '<td valign="top">Great idea! It looks delicious</td>', 'Great idea! It looks delicious', '2010-07-31 20:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
