(6116014, 899677, 51747, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Great capture! That looks like it''s a bit much for the Gull but man such great timing!</td>', 'WOW!  Great capture! That looks like it''s a bit much for the Gull but man such great timing!', '2010-08-03 20:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6116030, 900045, 51747, '<td valign="top">I always comment when I vote below 5. This type of shot could be much better if you used a tripod and a long exposure with a high aperture setting (f/11 or higher). What that would do is give you more of the image in focus and a more natural look to the image. Flash in this case is very harsh and unnatural looking. Better luck next time. Check the tutorials for more info about this type of shot.</td>', 'I always comment when I vote below 5. This type of shot could be much better if you used a tripod and a long exposure with a high aperture setting (f/11 or higher). What that would do is give you more of the image in focus and a more natural look to the image. Flash in this case is very harsh and unnatural looking. Better luck next time. Check the tutorials for more info about this type of shot.', '2010-08-03 20:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6116031, 899101, 51747, '<td valign="top">That Melon didn''t stand a chance! Nice perspective.</td>', 'That Melon didn''t stand a chance! Nice perspective.', '2010-08-03 20:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6116034, 899040, 51747, '<td valign="top">I always comment when I vote below 5. This type of shot could be much better if you used a tripod and a long exposure with a high aperture setting (f/11 or higher). What that would do is give you more of the image in focus and a more natural look to the image. Flash in this case is very harsh and unnatural looking. Better luck next time. Check the tutorials for more info about this type of shot.</td>', 'I always comment when I vote below 5. This type of shot could be much better if you used a tripod and a long exposure with a high aperture setting (f/11 or higher). What that would do is give you more of the image in focus and a more natural look to the image. Flash in this case is very harsh and unnatural looking. Better luck next time. Check the tutorials for more info about this type of shot.', '2010-08-03 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6116037, 900134, 51747, '<td valign="top">Yummm   I hope it was tasty. It sure looks good ;)</td>', 'Yummm   I hope it was tasty. It sure looks good ;)', '2010-08-03 20:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
