(6116046, 899606, 38162, '<td valign="top">windy title not necessary.  NB: lots of folks this challenge felt compelled to list the entire damn meal.  you at least gave us credit for knowing what a devil''s egg is.  nice job on this image.  a tad more sat for the reds would have helped; ditto more smart sharpen.  7</td>', 'windy title not necessary.  NB: lots of folks this challenge felt compelled to list the entire damn meal.  you at least gave us credit for knowing what a devil''s egg is.  nice job on this image.  a tad more sat for the reds would have helped; ditto more smart sharpen.  7', '2010-08-03 20:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
