(6116134, 899004, 33736, '<td valign="top">IF it was obviously a light bulb, and IF it were titled "Light Summer Meal", then Maybe it would have answered the Challenge.  Otherwise, as it is, it''s a lovely image.<br/> <br/>Btw, I''d love to know how you got this effect (vignetting?) out of the camera.</td>', 'IF it was obviously a light bulb, and IF it were titled "Light Summer Meal", then Maybe it would have answered the Challenge.  Otherwise, as it is, it''s a lovely image. Btw, I''d love to know how you got this effect (vignetting?) out of the camera.', '2010-08-03 21:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
