(6116150, 899767, 33736, '<td valign="top">You might want to shut off the "Dater" in your camera forever(too distracting for viewing pictures in general, and for competition entries - even if the date-print is allowed.)  I really did enjoy seeing this snapshot; it captured the feeling of a real-people picnic.</td>', 'You might want to shut off the "Dater" in your camera forever(too distracting for viewing pictures in general, and for competition entries - even if the date-print is allowed.)  I really did enjoy seeing this snapshot; it captured the feeling of a real-people picnic.', '2010-08-03 21:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
