(6116629, 900037, 102534, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snaffles:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the red and a lovely shot of that amazing cuisine.  Hope it was as good as it looks! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>even better :)</td>', 'Originally posted by snaffles: Congrats on the red and a lovely shot of that amazing cuisine.  Hope it was as good as it looks!  even better :)', '2010-08-04 01:50:12.000000', NULL, 0),
