(6118008, 900139, 83149, '<td valign="top">Well, a PB for a photo I wasn''t even going to enter.  My intent was to enter the Industrial challenge with this pic <a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/thecolliers/4838849763/in/set-72157620825660018/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.flickr.com/photos/thecolliers/4838849763/in/set-72157620825660018/</a>, but I decided to try a couple of shots for the meals challenge as well.  Apparently it was a good idea since I had taken the linked photo a day too early for the challenge.<br/> <br/>As for this photo, I wasn''t happy with the lighting either, as a few people mentioned.  That is why I wasn''t going to enter it.  My wife convinced me to enter it anyway as we both thought the idea was a good one.  Unfortunately with so many people around, including a half a dozen kids, the opportunities for trying a retake were non-existent.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments.</td>', 'Well, a PB for a photo I wasn''t even going to enter.  My intent was to enter the Industrial challenge with this pic //www.flickr.com/photos/thecolliers/4838849763/in/set-72157620825660018/, but I decided to try a couple of shots for the meals challenge as well.  Apparently it was a good idea since I had taken the linked photo a day too early for the challenge. As for this photo, I wasn''t happy with the lighting either, as a few people mentioned.  That is why I wasn''t going to enter it.  My wife convinced me to enter it anyway as we both thought the idea was a good one.  Unfortunately with so many people around, including a half a dozen kids, the opportunities for trying a retake were non-existent. Thanks for the comments.', '2010-08-04 16:20:48.000000', NULL, 0),
