(6118394, 900037, 103150, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed by which photos end up ribbon-ing. I guess I know nothing, sorry for the low mark :) Congrats!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I''m amazed by which photos end up ribbon-ing. I guess I know nothing, sorry for the low mark :) Congrats! ', '2010-08-04 21:10:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6118457, 900037, 102534, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by light_weaver:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m amazed by which photos end up ribbon-ing. I guess I know nothing, sorry for the low mark :) Congrats! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Everyone is entitled to their views Light Weaver, and i dont mind you voted low as you really didnt like the shot. Perhaps your constructive critique may need a little refining, but at least you didnt vote low for the "fun" of it, or to give your shot a better chance as some people do. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Originally posted by light_weaver: I''m amazed by which photos end up ribbon-ing. I guess I know nothing, sorry for the low mark :) Congrats!  Everyone is entitled to their views Light Weaver, and i dont mind you voted low as you really didnt like the shot. Perhaps your constructive critique may need a little refining, but at least you didnt vote low for the "fun" of it, or to give your shot a better chance as some people do. Happy shooting.', '2010-08-04 22:09:52.000000', NULL, 0),
